<title>USA: U.S. Bioscience says sells stake to ALZA.</title>
<headline>U.S. Bioscience says sells stake to ALZA.</headline>
<dateline>WEST CONSHOHOCKEN, Pa. 1997-03-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>U.S. Bioscience Inc said Tuesday it has completed the previously announced sale of 1.18 million new shares, representing 4.9 percent of its common stock, at $18.26 a share to ALZA Corp.</p>
<p>The company said proceeds of the stock sale totaled approximately $21.5 million.</p>
<p>A portion of the proceeds will be invested in programs supporting ALZA's cytoprotective agent, Ethyol.</p>
<p>ALZA is U.S. Bioscience's commercial partner in marketing some of its products in the United States.</p>
</text>
